#: src/Security/Modules/Headers.php:119
msgid "Sends a Permissions-Policy header that explicitly denies camera, microphone, geolocation, payment, USB, and other sensor APIs. Embedded iframes cannot request these without the site explicitly allowlisting them."
msgstr "Definido un Suficientes - Política cabecera que explícitamente denies camera, microphone, geolocation, pago, USB, y otros sensor APIs. Abre iframes no solicitud estos sin la sitio explícitamente allowlisting los."

#: src/Security/Modules/Headers.php:195
msgid "Sends Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only with a permissive default policy. Violations are visible in the browser DevTools console; nothing is blocked. Use this to validate a CSP before switching to enforce mode."
msgstr "Definido Contenido - Seguridad - Política - Denuncia - Solo con un permissive predeterminada política. Violations están visible en la navegador DevTools console; nada está bloqueo. Usa este a validate un CSP antes cambio a aplícalo modo."

#: src/Security/Modules/Headers.php:165
msgid "Sends Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin to isolate the browsing context from cross-origin windows opened via window.open or target=_blank links. Mitigates speculative-execution side-channel attacks."
msgstr "Definido Cross - Origin - Opener - Política: mismo - origin a isolate la browsing contexto desde cross - origin windows abierto via ventana. abrir o objetivo = _blank enlaces. Mitigates speculative - ejecuciones side - channel attacks."

#: src/Security/Modules/Headers.php:180
msgid "Sends Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-site to prevent other origins from embedding this site's resources. Subdomains are permitted; switch to same-origin in code for stricter isolation."
msgstr "Definido Cross - Origin - Recurso - Política: mismo - sitio a evitar otros origins desde embedding este site's recursos. Subdomains están permitted; switch a mismo - origin en código para stricter isolation."

#: src/Security/Modules/Headers.php:62
msgid "Sends modern security instructions with every page so visitor browsers know what is and isn't allowed. These instructions protect against clickjacking (an attacker placing your site invisibly on another page), MIME-sniffing (malicious files pretending to be images), and accidental data leaks. Visitors don't notice anything; their browser simply handles things more strictly behind the scenes."
msgstr "Definido modern seguridad instructions con cada página que visitante browsers know qué está y isn't permiso. Estos instructions proteger con clickjacking (un attacker placing tu sitio invisibly en otro página), MIME - sniffing (malicious archivos pretending a se imágenes), y accidental datos leaks. Visitantes don't aviso revisa; su navegador frecuencia identificadores things más strictly behind la scenes."

#: src/Security/Modules/Headers.php:103
msgid "Sends Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin so full URLs do not leak in Referer headers to external sites. Same-origin navigation still sends the full URL."
msgstr "Definido Referrer - Política: strict - origin - cuando - cross - origin que full URLs no no leak en Referer presentes a se sitios. Mismo - origin navegación aún definido la full URL."

#: src/Security/Modules/Headers.php:134
msgid "Sends Strict-Transport-Security with a 1-year max-age, forcing HTTPS enforcement by the browser. Only emitted on HTTPS requests (is_ssl()). WARNING: once received, browsers remember this even if the header is later removed, for the full max-age duration."
msgstr "Definido Strict - Transporte - Seguridad con un 1 - año max - age, forcing HTTPS aplicación por la navegador. Solo emitirse en HTTPS solicitudes (is_ssl ()). ADVERTENCIA: vez received, browsers remember este aunque si la cabecera está posterior eliminó, para la full max - age duración."

#: src/Security/Modules/Headers.php:87
msgid "Sends X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff to disable browser MIME-type sniffing. Prevents execution of content that was uploaded with a different Content-Type than the browser would infer."
msgstr "Definido X - Contenido - Tipo - Opciones: nosniff a desactiva navegador MIME - tipo sniffing. Prevents ejecuciones del contenido que se subido con un diferente Contenido - Tipo una la navegador denegarían infer."

#: src/Security/Modules/Headers.php:71
msgid "Sends X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN to prevent the site from being rendered inside an <iframe> on third-party domains. Mitigates clickjacking."
msgstr "Envía X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN para impedir que el sitio se muestre dentro de un <iframe> en dominios de terceros. Mitiga el clickjacking."

#: src/Security/Modules/Headers.php:150
msgid "Sends X-XSS-Protection: 0 to explicitly disable the deprecated browser XSS auditor. The auditor is known to introduce its own side-channel vulnerabilities; modern browsers ignore it, but setting it defensively suppresses stale defaults in older clients."
msgstr "Definido X - XSS - Protección: 0 a explícitamente desactiva la deprecated navegador XSS auditor. La auditor está conocida a introduce su propia side - channel vulnerabilities; modern browsers ignore que, pero ajuste que defensively suppresses stale valores en older clientes."

#: src/Admin/Admin.php:1209
msgid "Sensitive output rendered in a separate dialog and not stored here."
msgstr "Sensitive salida páginas en un independientes dialog y no almacenado aquí."

#: templates/mail-log.php:35 templates/mail-log.php:78
msgid "Sent"
msgstr "Envía"

